{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼今天就到這裡。大家，明天也請加油喔！」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "mc0353", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「起立。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5577", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「敬禮。」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室一口氣熱鬧起來。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個那個，考試還沒有結束，請不要放鬆過頭喔！」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "mc0354", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒問題的啦，老師。」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1148", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也對，大家都懂的吧。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "mc0355", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天也還有考試，要是現在放鬆之後就慘了。吶，新吾也這麼想吧？」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1149", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要玩就等考試都結束再玩就好。」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯，就是說啊。」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "mc0356", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到老師連連點頭，大多數的同學都露出「既然妳都這麼說了」的表情。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在這時。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『明明自己就在跟妹妹玩。』", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……？」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "什麼？", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我四處張望。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是剛才的聲音立刻混入教室的喧鬧中……已經找不到是從哪裡傳來的了。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剛才……是什麼？", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是聽錯吧？", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺到彷彿墨汁滲出般的漆黑情緒。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1150", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那大家就加油喔♪」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "mc0357", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老師比平時腳步更輕快地離開了。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除此之外沒有任何異狀。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像平常放學後的教室。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你從剛才就在東張西望什麼？」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1151", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有點事情。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「做了什麼心虛的事嗎？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，不是。」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不准回答得那麼乾脆，稍微猶豫一下啦！」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2198", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『唔哇，好厚臉皮。』", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1152", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2199", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他們兩人都露出吃到苦瓜般的表情。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……看來不是我聽錯。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶，新吾──」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1153", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3440", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太正想說什麼，櫻乃剛好來到我們教室。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3441", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃走向我們。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真快啊，櫻乃那邊結束了嗎？」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3442", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有好幾個人在看我們……大概是在看我跟櫻乃。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然這不是什麼罕見的事……", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好像有點不一樣？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是？」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3443", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃歪著頭。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……如果櫻乃沒注意到，那就是我想太多了吧。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小櫻乃，今天考得怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1154", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還可以。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3444", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊，那新吾呢？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1155", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還行吧。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，你也只有現在能說那種話了。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2200", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「公布結果後你就會說『對不起出生在這世界上』。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2201", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想應該不會說那種話啦。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「給我不服輸一點啊！」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2202", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有自信是好事，但是差不多就好了。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5578", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼？」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2203", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太大聲會給人添麻煩。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5579", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……出生在這世界上對不起。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2204", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪學姊先說了呢。」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3445", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼有幹勁是很好。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5580", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學怎麼樣呢？」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟平常一樣。」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5580b", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這就是那種資優生的派頭！」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，不管你怎麼努力都贏不過愛理的吧！」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪學姊在借用愛理的威風了。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3446", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的……所謂考試，比起結果，自己學了什麼才更重要吧？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5581", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學看不下去地說。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，那是考得好的人的理論喔。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得小乾也是考得好的那邊的說。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1156", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為了追隨美羽學姊，我可不能因為這種程度就倒下！」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我不才能輸給什麼瓜生。為了展示實力，我要贏，然後打倒你！」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2209", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我好像稍微理解小乾的思考模式了。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1157", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，說的也是。」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手段在不知不覺中變成了目的吧。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思，今天我要先回去了。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 424, "voice": "ht1158", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我們也走吧。」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理也一起回家吧？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3447", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5582", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天也要一起用功嗎？」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3448", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會打擾你們？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5583", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾？」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3449", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你們兩個人一起念書對吧？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5584", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。但是愛理老師在的話我會很高興。」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3450", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不是那個意思……」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5585", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們決定考試期間要專心在這件事情上了。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那樣嗎？」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5586", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，不嫌棄的話我就陪你們一起用功吧。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5587", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學願意的話就太好了。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔也要～安潔也想被叫去！這樣下去會被趕出學校的～」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……糟糕到那種程度啊。」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。與其說糟糕，用淒慘來形容感覺更貼切！」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了。那我就好好指導妳，指導到妳吐出來為止。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5588", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安潔現在，或許站在了人生的分叉路口上！」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然念書還是靠自己──」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，走吧。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5589", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學拎著安潔的脖子把她拖走了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛愛愛愛愛理同學，打掃用具很寂寞、很寂寞地在呼喚安潔！」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考試前常有的事。不用在意。」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5590", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已經受夠英文字母跟算式跟漢字了啦～」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪學姊要跟愛理一起念書嗎？」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3451", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比起考試結果，自己學了什麼才更重要對吧！」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 420, "voice": "sn2210", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然她說的是正確的，可是不知為何，乾同學的話聽起來有點空洞。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安潔，妳還好嗎？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……感覺只要頭稍微一歪，今天記住的東西就會全部流出來了。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3605", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果變成那樣，就重頭開始再學一次。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5591", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「──唔！」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3606", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔頓時僵住。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我去準備茶吧？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3607", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
