{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳太誇張了。畢竟用功到這種程度了，明天的考試應該沒什麼問題了吧。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "ar5592", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
